=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_5c8d — The Coffee Table Game: Out All Afternoon, Shelved by Eight

The board game lives on the coffee table in the living room for most of the day. Priya and Hana (and guests on Wednesday and Thursday evenings) use it in the afternoon. The 16:00 weekday passes show it on the coffee table three out of four times; the weekend passes show it there every single time. It is the default resting spot when not in active play.

On weekdays, by 18:00 the game is put away on the bookshelf. The 18:00 pass shows it on the bookshelf. This is a consistent evening tidying: after the afternoon session (or after guests leave), the box goes back to the shelf. On weekends it stays on the coffee table all day because there is no evening deadline.

This document differs from p_6a1b (which claims the game stays on the bookshelf on Wednesday and Friday afternoons — contradicted by 6 against sightings) and from p_a7b2's Tuesday claim (game on bookshelf Tuesday afternoon — contradicted by 6 against). The game is on the coffee table on ALL weekday afternoons, not just Wed/Fri.

What would refute this: finding the board game on the bookshelf at 15:00 on a weekday, or finding it on the coffee table at 19:00 on a weekday.

