=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_9b4e — Weekend Vacuum Out, Weekday Storage In

The vacuum cleaner follows a strict day-type split. On weekends, both residents are home and the house gets cleaned. The vacuum is pulled out of storage and sits on the living room floor (floor_l_l1) from early morning through the evening. The weekend passes at 00:00, 08:00, and 16:00 all show it on the floor. It is out and ready, or actively being used.

On weekdays, Hana is at work and Priya is not doing a full house clean. The vacuum stays in the storage room on the floor (storage_floor_s1). The weekday 00:00 and 08:00 passes show it in storage. The 16:00 pass is mixed (2 storage, 2 floor) suggesting an occasional mid-week tidy, but the dominant pattern is storage.

This differs from p_6c9a (which limits the weekend floor window to 8–16 h and the weekday storage window to 14–17 h). The evidence shows the vacuum on the floor at 00:00 on weekends (overnight, left out after cleaning) and in storage at 00:00 on weekdays. The windows should be full-day, not partial.

What would refute this: finding the vacuum in storage at 10:00 on a Saturday, or on the living room floor at 10:00 on a weekday.

